  "question": {
    "text": "The area (in sq. units) of the circle touching the line <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> at <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and intersecting <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> orthogonally is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
